Package: KiekkoStatsit
Title: Collect and Clean Hockey Stats from Liiga and the NHL
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "XDMAKKAra",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "XDMAKKAra@users.noreply.github.com"),
    person(given = "Daniel",
           family = "Morse",
           role = c("aut", "cph"),
           email = "danmorse8642@gmail.com",
           comment = "Author of hockeyR, which this package is built on"))
Description: Functions to collect Finnish Liiga data from <https://liiga.fi/>,
    including schedules, goals, shot locations, box scores, standings and
    player stats. Also scrapes NHL play-by-play data from <https://www.nhl.com/>
    and standings, player stats and jersey number history from
    <https://www.hockey-reference.com/>. Built on the 'hockeyR' package.
